nt/20230707/16887046047453.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：苹果往下落，当碰到了蓝色时就不见了"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：苹果往下落，当碰到了绿色时就不见了"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C：苹果往下落，当碰到了红色时就不见了"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D：苹果一直往下落，不会隐藏"}]}],"answer":"A","analysis":"苹果初始状态为显示，重复执行将y坐标增加-3，直到碰得蓝色，则苹果为隐藏状态，然后停止全部脚本。所以苹果往下落，当碰到蓝色时候就不见了。","auto":true},{"no":8,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"小明数学考了88分，语文比数学多考了2分，英语比语文少考了5分，请问小明英语考了多少分？（　）"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：88分"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：90分"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C：85分"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D：83分"}]}],"answer":"C","analysis":"数学考了88分，语文比数学多考了2分，那么语文为90分，英语比语文少考了5分，那么英语为85分。","auto":true},{"no":9,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"根据以下规律，请问位置7上应该放置什么图形？（ ）"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230707/16887174343974.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230707/16887174557865.png"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230707/16887174642339.png"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230707/16887174748207.png"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230707/16887174832038.png"}]}],"answer":"C","analysis":"根据规律，7号位置放正方形。","auto":true},{"no":10,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"现有“车”和“车位”两个角色，角色初始位置如下图所示，运行一次程序，模拟倒车入库的过程，①处应填写？（ ）"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230707/16887175369897.png"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230707/16887175478350.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230707/16887175729551.png"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230707/16887175812441.png"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C："},{"img":"https://ww